#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:9
msgid "Demos"
msgstr "演示"

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:11
msgid ""
"Select a demo, choose its backend and visualizer, then copy the command to "
"run it locally. No source checkout is required."
msgstr "选择演示及其后端、可视化器，再复制命令到本地运行，无需检出源码。"

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:155
msgid "More examples"
msgstr "更多示例"

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:157
msgid "List all demos or focused API examples:"
msgstr "列出所有演示或专题 API 示例："

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:164
msgid ""
"Run a focused example with ``isaaclab example <name>``. In the Newton GL "
"viewer, the **Isaac Lab Programs** panel lets you switch between available "
"demos and examples."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``isaaclab example <name>`` 运行专题示例。在 Newton GL 查看器中，可通过 **Isaac Lab "
"Programs** 面板切换可用的演示和示例。"

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:168
msgid "MicroDuck Warehouse rendering"
msgstr "MicroDuck 仓库渲染"

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:170
msgid ""
"View the static MicroDuck Warehouse through selectable renderers and saved "
"cameras, without advancing physics."
msgstr "使用可切换的渲染器和保存的相机，查看静态 MicroDuck 仓库，不推进物理仿真。"

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:178
msgid ""
"Use ``presets=aisle`` for the alternate camera and output presets such as "
"``depth`` or ``normals``. For full MDL minimal shading, select "
"``renderer=isaacsim_rtx presets=minimal``."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``presets=aisle`` 切换相机，使用 ``depth`` 或 ``normals`` 等输出预设。若需采用完整 MDL "
"的最简着色，选择 ``renderer=isaacsim_rtx presets=minimal``。"

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:185
msgid "SONIC on gravel and sand"
msgstr "碎石与沙地上的 SONIC"

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:187
msgid ""
"The SONIC demo runs a G1 robot over gravel and sand with Newton MJWarp and "
"MPM, or Isaac Sim PhysX and PBD. It requires an NVIDIA GPU and uses Kit for "
"RTX rendering."
msgstr ""
"SONIC 演示使用 Newton MJWarp 与 MPM，或 Isaac Sim PhysX 与 PBD，让 G1 机器人穿越碎石和沙地。它需要 "
"NVIDIA GPU，并使用 Kit 进行 RTX 渲染。"

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:190
msgid ""
"From the repository root, install the simulator, recording dependencies, and"
" the additional packages used to download and run the released ONNX models:"
msgstr "从仓库根目录安装仿真器、录制依赖，以及下载和运行已发布 ONNX 模型所需的额外包："

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:198
msgid ""
"The demo downloads the planner and tracker from `nvidia/GEAR-SONIC "
"<https://huggingface.co/nvidia/GEAR-SONIC>`_ at a pinned revision. The robot"
" USD is downloaded from the public Isaac asset server."
msgstr ""
"演示从 `nvidia/GEAR-SONIC <https://huggingface.co/nvidia/GEAR-SONIC>`_ "
"的固定修订版下载规划器和跟踪器，从公开的 Isaac 资产服务器下载机器人 USD。"

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:202
msgid "Run either backend:"
msgstr "运行任一后端："

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:212
msgid ""
"Without ``--viz``, Newton records offscreen with Kit/RTX and opens no "
"simulation window; PhysX opens Kit and records only with ``--video``. Both "
"commands above save ``sonic_0000.mp4`` in the selected output directory "
"(``logs/sonic`` when ``--output`` is omitted). The terminal reports "
"simulation progress. Recording advances in simulation time, so the full MPM "
"scene can take substantially longer than the video duration. Pass "
"``--seconds`` to change the simulation duration."
msgstr ""
"未设置 ``--viz`` 时，Newton 使用 Kit/RTX 离屏录制，不打开仿真窗口；PhysX 打开 Kit，且只有提供 "
"``--video`` 才录制。上述两个命令都将 ``sonic_0000.mp4`` 保存到所选输出目录，省略 ``--output`` 时为 "
"``logs/sonic``。终端会报告仿真进度。录制按仿真时间推进，因此完整 MPM 场景的运行时间可能远长于视频时长。传入 "
"``--seconds`` 可更改仿真时长。"

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:219
msgid ""
"Pass ``--viz newton_gl`` or ``--viz kit`` to open a Newton simulation window"
" instead. With an explicit ``--viz`` selection, recording is opt-in via "
"``--video``."
msgstr ""
"也可传入 ``--viz newton_gl`` 或 ``--viz kit`` 打开 Newton 仿真窗口。显式选择 ``--viz`` 后，需通过"
" ``--video`` 才启用录制。"

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:222
msgid ""
"Append ``env.sim.device=cuda:1`` to select a different CUDA device for "
"physics and SONIC inference. PhysX keeps state buffers on the CPU for USD "
"readback while particle simulation uses the selected GPU."
msgstr ""
"追加 ``env.sim.device=cuda:1``，可为物理仿真和 SONIC 推理选择其他 CUDA 设备。PhysX 将状态缓冲区保留在 "
"CPU 以便 USD 回读，粒子仿真则使用所选 GPU。"

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:226
msgid ""
"``uv run`` preserves the manually installed packages. If you run ``uv sync``"
" again, repeat the ``uv pip install`` command before launching SONIC."
msgstr ""
"``uv run`` 会保留手动安装的包。若再次执行 ``uv sync``，启动 SONIC 前需重新执行 ``uv pip install`` "
"命令。"

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:232
msgid "Focused examples"
msgstr "专题示例"

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:237
msgid "Tablecloth trick (Newton VBD, experimental)"
msgstr "抽桌布实验（Newton VBD，实验性）"

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:239
msgid ""
"Three H2 Plus robots comparing cloth pulls in the Cloth Pull Challenge "
"cantina."
msgstr "三个 H2 Plus 机器人在 Cloth Pull Challenge 酒馆场景中比较不同速度的桌布抽拉。"

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:243
msgid ""
"Native Kit viewport with the three pull stations aligned and interior "
"lighting enabled."
msgstr "原生 Kit 视口，三个抽拉工位排列整齐，并启用室内光照。"

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:245
msgid ""
"Three H2 Plus robots with SHARPA hands pull tablecloths at different speeds "
"in the Cloth Pull Challenge cantina. Newton VBD simulates the cloth, "
"tableware, and contact-driven grasps; scripted IK controls the fixed-base "
"robots. The contact settings prioritize accuracy over real-time throughput."
msgstr ""
"三个装有 SHARPA 手的 H2 Plus 机器人，在 Cloth Pull Challenge 酒馆场景中以不同速度抽拉桌布。Newton VBD "
"模拟布料、餐具和通过接触实现的抓握，脚本化 IK 控制固定基座机器人。接触设置优先保证精度，而非实时吞吐量。"

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:254
msgid ""
"Newton GL is the default visualizer. For the Isaac Sim RTX viewport, install"
" the ``isaacsim`` extra and select ``--visualizer kit``."
msgstr ""
"默认可视化器为 Newton GL。若需 Isaac Sim RTX 视口，安装 ``isaacsim`` extra 并选择 "
"``--visualizer kit``。"

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:261
msgid ""
"Kit videos: `five-speed overview <https://github.com/user-"
"attachments/assets/6a22e791-ed3c-4488-9853-6e8afdbcbcc2>`__ and `wider-side "
"grasp and pull <https://github.com/user-"
"attachments/assets/27ac0365-e862-4d60-bd85-51f585a580d5>`__."
msgstr ""
"Kit 视频：`五种速度概览 <https://github.com/user-"
"attachments/assets/6a22e791-ed3c-4488-9853-6e8afdbcbcc2>`__ 和 `较宽侧抓取与抽拉 "
"<https://github.com/user-"
"attachments/assets/27ac0365-e862-4d60-bd85-51f585a580d5>`__。"

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:266
msgid "Sharpa RJ45"
msgstr "Sharpa RJ45"

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:270
msgid "A SHARPA hand holding a green RJ45 connector at a GB300 switch port."
msgstr "SHARPA 手在 GB300 交换机端口处握着绿色 RJ45 接头。"

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:274
msgid "Kit preview with optional GB300 rack visuals."
msgstr "Kit 预览，可选显示 GB300 机架。"

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:276
msgid ""
"A scripted Rizon 4s and SHARPA hand insert, release, regrasp and extract an "
"RJ45 connector in one continuous simulation. The non-RL manager-based "
"example uses native hydroelastic hand contact, a spring clip and a VBD "
"cable."
msgstr ""
"由脚本控制的 Rizon 4s 与 SHARPA 手，在一次连续仿真中插入、松开、重新抓取并拔出 RJ45 "
"接头。该示例采用管理器式环境，不使用强化学习，包含原生静水弹性手部接触、弹簧卡扣和 VBD 线缆。"

#: source/isaaclab/demos.rst:284
msgid ""
"From a checkout, use ``uv run isaaclab example sharpa-rj45``. NewtonGL "
"displays one GB300 rack; ``--viz kit`` and ``--viz newton_rtx`` load the "
"full render-only data center without adding physics geometry. Requires the "
"external Rizon/SHARPA robot asset bundle; see the :download:`asset and "
"recording setup "
"<../../../source/isaaclab_tasks/isaaclab_tasks/contrib/gb300_sharpa_insertion/README.md>`."
msgstr ""
"在源码目录中运行 ``uv run isaaclab example sharpa-rj45``。NewtonGL 显示一个 GB300 "
"机架，``--viz kit`` 和 ``--viz newton_rtx`` 则加载完整的数据中心可视场景，不增加物理几何。示例需要外部 "
"Rizon/SHARPA 机器人资产包，见 :download:`资产与录制配置 "
"<../../../source/isaaclab_tasks/isaaclab_tasks/contrib/gb300_sharpa_insertion/README.md>`。"
